"""Manual multimodal annotation of the France vs Japan X war, 2026-10-27.

Annotator: Claude (Opus 5.5), reading post text, images (contact sheets of every photo and
video thumbnail) and the "Quotes" tab of each top post in Chrome.

Unit = one post. Fields:
  community  who speaks: FR, JA, EN, AR, KO, TH, ES, PT, CN (language + self-identification)
  side       which camp the idea serves: FR, JA, NEU (neutral, meta, confused)
  concept    the contested ground (camp-agnostic), see CONCEPTS
  idea       the claim in one neutral English line, including the implied meaning of jokes
  register   humor, insult, argument, info, testimony, meta
  rel        for quotes: rebut (other idea against the parent), amplify (same side, new angle),
             verdict (spectator judging the fight), restate (same idea)
"""

